=== Normal Response ===
Kaelor Windforge is a fictional character from the "Dragon Age" series of video games, developed by BioWare. He is a dwarf rogue and a member of the Dalish elven community in the game's world. Kaelor appears in the third game, "Dragon Age: Inquisition," as a companion character who can join the Inquisitor's party. He is known for his skills in traps and lock-picking, as well as his complex backstory and personal struggles. However, it's important to note that the lore and characters in video games can vary, so the information provided here is based on the general consensus and common knowledge about the character.

